40. 452.8899999999999864 Td
(Safaricom SEMA is an enterprise-grade citizen incident reporting and automated dispatch engine designed for Safaricom PLC) Tj
T* (Kenya. The system eliminates communication friction by providing zero-barrier voice and text reporting across all 47 Kenyan) Tj
T* (counties in English, Kiswahili Sanifu, and Kenyan Sheng. Powered by Google Gemini 2.5 AI, real-time in-browser speech) Tj
T* (recognition, audio frequency analysis, and automated Network Operations Center \(NOC\) field engineer dispatch, SEMA cuts) Tj
T* (incident triage time from hours to seconds while tracking high-tension subscriber sentiment and enforcing strict SLA resolution) Tj
T* (milestones.) Tj
ET
